band.MountConductance,Mass=defaultSpacecraftDesignConfig.communication.baseband.Mass,RCM_X=defaultSpacecraftDesignConfig.communication.baseband.RCM_X,RCM_Y=defaultSpacecraftDesignConfig.communication.baseband.RCM_Y,RCM_Z=defaultSpacecraftDesignConfig.communication.baseband.RCM_Z,Inertia_XX=defaultSpacecraftDesignConfig.communication.b …（完整表达式见源码）</pre></html>"));
